将及，非奔不免，则必逃死苟存，无希荣利矣：然则高位厚禄，何为者哉？魏初有孟达、黄权，在晋有孙秀、孙楷。达、权爵赏，比壹为轻；秀、楷礼秩，优异尤甚。及至吴平，而降黜数等；不承权舆，岂不缘在始失中乎？","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":574,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ad4fae97affa47236d4e","start":0,"end":228,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-4adb8436412b9dece098","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-a88c6de5793fe771ffb5","layer":"original","quote":"皓数遣诘楷，楷常惶怖；而猝被召，遂将妻子亲兵数百人，归晋","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-62b7a2be010c167ef786","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-a88c6de5793fe771ffb5","layer":"original","quote":"天玺元年，征楷为宫下镇、骠骑将军","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-6f22acd0114bfd6c352a","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-d55d332c5caf0bed8f6d","layer":"pei","quote":"吴平，降为渡辽将军。永安元年卒","attribution":"裴注·晋诸公赞","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3b8434596dd69ecb5c0a","start":12,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-81c63aef25eb9c9d0ed8","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-a88c6de5793fe771ffb5","layer":"original","quote":"晋以为车骑将军，封丹杨侯","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":83,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-93b0d6b5e1a63d078663","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-a88c6de5793fe771ffb5","layer":"original","quote":"初，永安贼施但等，劫皓弟谦，袭建业；或白楷二端不即赴讨者","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":21,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q2-752f6d4c63082903b474","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-d55d332c5caf0bed8f6d","layer":"pei","quote":"永安元年卒。","attribution":"裴注·晋诸公赞","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3b8434596dd69ecb5c0a","start":22,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
